WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:12.091
Jeb drove between the cones.

2
00:00:12.092 --> 00:00:22.552
"Very safe driving!" said Ms. Fender.

3
00:00:22.553 --> 00:00:27.088
Jeb drove toward a stop sign.

4
00:00:27.089 --> 00:00:31.101
"Obey the sign," said Ms. Fender.

5
00:00:31.102 --> 00:00:33.793
Jeb stopped at the sign.

6
00:00:33.794 --> 00:00:36.133
He looked both ways.

7
00:00:36.134 --> 00:00:42.917
Then he drove some more.

8
00:00:42.918 --> 00:00:45.666
A green light turned yellow.

9
00:00:45.667 --> 00:00:48.001
Jeb slowed down.

10
00:00:48.002 --> 00:00:50.721
The light turned red.

11
00:00:50.722 --> 00:00:53.378
Jeb stopped.

12
00:00:53.379 --> 00:00:55.917
Zippy whispered to Eddy.

13
00:00:55.918 --> 00:00:59.308
"You're good at slowing down.

14
00:00:59.309 --> 00:01:01.997
Because you're slow!"

15
00:01:01.998 --> 00:01:05.464
"I'm not slow," said Eddy.

16
00:01:05.465 --> 00:01:09.919
The light turned green.

17
00:01:09.920 --> 00:01:15.756
Jeb drove some more.

18
00:01:15.757 --> 00:01:22.129
Soon he was done.

19
00:01:22.130 --> 00:01:25.673
"Good job," said Ms. Fender.

20
00:01:25.674 --> 00:01:32.420
"It's Zippy's turn now."

21
00:01:32.421 --> 00:01:35.918
Zippy drove to the track.

22
00:01:35.919 --> 00:01:38.311
Zippy smiled.

23
00:01:38.312 --> 00:01:43.962
"This will be easy!

24
00:01:43.963 --> 00:01:49.657
I'm the best at everything!"

